member.summary:
The single, pre-configured entry point for serializing and deserializing ActivityStreams /
ActivityPub types. All JSON in Iris goes through this class so that the
@context, content type, and polymorphic converters are consistent across the codebase.

member.returns:
when nowUtc <= FreshUntilUtc;
when FreshUntilUtc < nowUtc <= UsableUntilUtc;
when nowUtc > UsableUntilUtc.

